# Repo-specific exclusions for scripts/secret-scan.sh, one git pathspec per
# line. The scanner is the fleet's canonical copy and stays byte-identical
# across repos, so anything only this repo needs to skip lives here. Every
# entry is a silent pre-exemption for whatever lands at that path later.

# Dependency lockfile: hashes and vendored author emails are noise, not leaks
# from this project.
frontend/package-lock.json

# The never-ship set: private working documents this snapshot does NOT carry,
# so the scan enforces cleanliness of the SHIP SET rather than of private
# history. An entry belongs here only if the file is absent from the published
# tree; check `git ls-files` before adding one. CHANGELOG.md and CLAUDE.md do
# not belong here: both are tracked and ship, and listing them once exempted
# two published files from every matcher. Removing an entry below without also
# removing the file from the publication drop-list would be a mistake.
DECISIONS.md
BACKLOG.md
CLAUDE.local.md
RELEASING.md
docs/COLLABORATOR_SAFETY.md
package-lock.json
